#: build-src/database/migrations.md:1
msgid "Database migrations"
msgstr "Migration de base de données"

#: build-src/database/migrations.md:3
msgid ""
"NumaHOP uses liquibase community for managing its database migrations. It "
"also serves as an initializer for the empty database during the installation."
msgstr ""
"NumaHOP utilise liquibase community pour gerer ses migrations. Cela sert "
"aussia l'initialization de la base lors de l'installation."

#: build-src/database/migrations.md:5
msgid ""
"The documentation for liquibase is available [here](https://"
"docs.liquibase.com/community)."
msgstr ""
"La documentation de liquibase est disponible [ici](https://"
"docs.liquibase.com/community)."

#: build-src/database/migrations.md:7
msgid "How liquibase works"
msgstr "Comment liquibase fonctionne"

#: build-src/database/migrations.md:9
msgid ""
"Liquibase creates two additional tables inside the database "
"`DATABASECHANGELOG` and `DATABASECHANGELOGLOCK` it uses these to compare the "
"changelog steps that were applied to the database and the ones it knows "
"about and apply the missing ones."
msgstr ""
"Liquibase crée deux tables suplémentaires en base `DATABASECHANGELOG` et "
"`DATABASECHANGELOGLOCK`. Il utilise celles-ci pour comparer les étapes du "
"journal de changements appliquées avec celles dont il a connaissance et "
"applique les étapes manquantes."

#: build-src/database/migrations.md:11
msgid "How liquibase is setup"
msgstr "Comment liquibase est mis en place"

#: build-src/database/migrations.md:13
msgid ""
"The liquibase changelog is split in multiple changelog xml files all "
"referenced in a master changelog. These are located under `src/main/"
"resources/config/liquibase`"
msgstr ""
"Le changelog est separee en plusieurs fichiers xml references dans un "
"journal de changements maître. Ces fichiers sont dans le dossier `src/main/"
"resources/config/liquibase`."

#: build-src/database/migrations.md:16
msgid "Adding a changelog"
msgstr "Ajouter une étape"

#: build-src/database/migrations.md:18
msgid ""
"Each developpement that modify the database should add a new individual "
"changelog file and add it at the end of the `master.xml` changelog file."
msgstr ""
"Chaque developpement modifiant la schéma de la base doit ajouter une "
"nouvelle étape et la référencer dans le fichier `master.xml`."

#: build-src/database/migrations.md:20
msgid ""
"Please name the changelog file with a descriptive name so that it is "
"representative of what the changelog does."
msgstr ""
"Les étapes doivent avoir un nom de fichier reflétant les changements du "
"schéma."
